              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_116",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("The aggressive saurians are vanquished, but the undead are the greater evil here. We must not waver!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_117",
        on: "sighted",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_sighted_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22leader2%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_seer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Master. Is away. I guard. I will fight. Until Iliah. Malal returns."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mad.webp",
            text: _("Your master Malal is gone, you undead fool! Go back to your eternal rest."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Iliah-Malal? That is the lich we fought in the swamp. What would one of his minions be doing here? And why is it so powerful!?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("It speaks of guarding — perhaps Malal has a sanctuary hidden somewhere else in these hills. I do not think we have time to search for it, though. Perhaps a task for another hero, another time."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_118",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 30,
            y: 13,
            item_name: "",
            image: "items%2Fbook1.png",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_119",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 29,
            y: 12,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_item",
            x: 30,
            y: 13,
            item_name: "",
            image: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("There is an old book here, labeled <i>“Isaac Mallat — Journal.”</i> The running water has washed away most of the ink, but one passage is still readable..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<i>_ —died in my arms. My own brother! He could have been saved!! This imbecile king’s quarantine will be the end of us all. _ I’m sure I’m not contagious. I’m sure there’s some way to cure it. If I sneak out of the village and make my way north to—</i>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_121",
        on: "branch_if_121",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "i",
